OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy or
OL,6,Fpartly cloudy during this evening and
OL,7,Fovernight with a scattering of
OL,8,Fshowers, mainly in the north. Light or
OL,9,Fmoderate west or northwest winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FMainly dry with bright spells,
OL,12,Falthough it could turn dull over
OL,13,FShetland with patchy light rain
OL,14,Fthrough the afternoon. Light or
OL,15,Fmoderate northwest winds.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FPlenty
OL,18,Fdry and settled weather under a large
OL,19,Farea of high pressure. Variable cloud
OL,20,Famounts with some clear or sunny
OL,21,Fspells possible at times. Light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
